FR:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}La préservation du patrimoine
{{TAG:000E:000A:0600640065002000040064002700}}{{TAG:0005:0005:}} est l'affaire de tous.{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
Et l'histoire naturelle en fait partie !

EN:
I'm here to study how fossilized
plants and animals differ from
modern ones.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000A:}}I only wish there were more here{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}È davvero beeello studiare la storia
del mondo attraverso i fossili.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Come vorrei che qui ce ne fossero
sempre di più{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¿En tu pueblo hay muchos fósiles?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Me gustaría acercarme un día a
investigar un poco{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Si trovano fossili nella tua città?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Mi piacerebbe tantissimissimo
scovarne di nuovi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Senin kasabanda çok fosil var mı?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
Bir gün oraya keşif gezisine çıkmak
isterim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I bet our museum would draw quite
a crowd if we had more fossils.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I hope we get more donations soon!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Daha çok fosilimiz olsa müzemiz
kalabalığı çekerdi bence.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Umarım yakında daha çok bağış gelir!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}El museo me llena de orgullo.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Los vecinos han donado fósiles
encontrados por la zona!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sono fiera di questa esposizione.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Qui sono in mostra tutti i fossili
della zona.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Fantastique!
